---
import { identity } from "../data/ascii";
import { site } from "../data/site";
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="About Benjamin Anderson, an electronics engineer working across hardware, firmware and product design."
>
  <div class="container">
    <header class="page-header">
      <p class="breadcrumb">~/about</p>
      <h1>About</h1>
      <p>
        A short system profile: what I work on, the tools I reach for, and what
        I am building now.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="about-grid">
      <figure class="identity-panel">
        <pre aria-hidden="true">{identity}</pre>
        <figcaption>Benjamin Anderson / engiebenji.com</figcaption>
      </figure>

      <div class="about-body">
        <p class="eyebrow">profile / benji</p>

        <dl class="facts">
          <dt>user</dt>
          <dd>{site.name}</dd>

          <dt>role</dt>
          <dd>Electronics engineer</dd>

          <dt>focus</dt>
          <dd>Hardware design, embedded systems and PCB development</dd>

          <dt>tools</dt>
          <dd>KiCad, FreeCAD, Blender, OpenSCAD, C, C++, Python</dd>

          <dt>education</dt>
          <dd>Electronic engineering graduate</dd>

          <dt>currently</dt>
          <dd>Rebuilding engiebenji.com</dd>

          <dt>links</dt>
          <dd>
            <a href={site.github} rel="me">
              GitHub
            </a>{" "}
            /
            <a href={site.linkedin} rel="me">
              LinkedIn
            </a>{" "}
            /<a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>Email</a>
          </dd>
        </dl>

        <div class="prose">
          <p>
            I enjoy the process of moulding the ideas in my head into something
            tangible, then fine tuning it until it is exactly what I envisioned.
            Whether it is the PCBs controlling a new device, the renders for a
            project thumbnail, or the code that makes it work, I care about the
            details.
          </p>
          <p>
            My work sits between electronics and product design: schematic
            capture and PCB layout, firmware, mechanical design, and the small
            tools that make the next build easier. I am particularly interested
            in projects that reward careful iteration, from custom input devices
            to compact display hardware.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="actions">
          <a class="button" href={site.cv}>
            Download CV
          </a>
          <a class="button" href="/projects/">
            See projects
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
